    dmo:statement "Divide the total dose of insulin administered in last 6 hours of the VRIII by 6 to calculate average hourly dose of insulin. Multiply this by 20 (not 24, to reduce risk of hypoglycaemia) to estimate the patient’s total daily insulin requirement" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Divide the total dose of insulin administered in last 6 hours of the VRIII by 6 to calculate average hourly dose of insulin. Multiply this by 20 (not 24, to reduce risk of hypoglycaemia) to estimate the patient’s total daily insulin requirement" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_09_ip_vriii> .

