<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/stepping-down-from-vriii-to-subcutaneous-insulin-in-tpn-patients> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "Stepping Down from VRIII to Subcutaneous Insulin in TPN Patients" ;
    dmo:populationScope "Patients on TPN with achieved glycaemic control" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "stepping-down-from-vriii-to-subcutaneous-insulin-in-tpn-patients" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Treatment" ;
    dmo:statement "Once glycaemic control is obtained patients should be stepped down to subcutaneous insulin as soon as possible. The regime chosen should reflect the fact the caloric intake will be a continuous infusion over 24 hours rather than, for instance, as 3 meals a day. The usual regimens of basal bolus or twice daily premixed insulin will not be suitable. In this special circumstance twice daily isophane insulin is recommended." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Once glycaemic control is obtained patients should be stepped down to subcutaneous insulin as soon as possible. The regime chosen should reflect the fact the caloric intake will be a continuous infusion over 24 hours rather than, for instance, as 3 meals a day. The usual regimens of basal bolus or twice daily premixed insulin will not be suitable. In this special circumstance twice daily isophane insulin is recommended." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_09_ip_vriii> .

