    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_09_ip_vriii> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/riskFactor/hyperglycemia-in-patients-with-community-acquired-pneumonia> a dmo:RiskFactor ;
